hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16046","Uthman ibn Muhammad narrated to us, and I heard it myself from Uthman ibn Muhammad ibn Abi Shaybah, he said, Said ibn Khuthaym al-Hilali narrated to us, he said, I heard my grandmother Rabiah bint Iyad saying, I heard my grandfather Ubaydah ibn Amr al-Kilabi saying, I saw the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) perform ablution, and he performed ablution thoroughly. He said, and Rabiah, when she performed ablution, would perform it thoroughly."
